tification  for stuff like calendar events messages  missed calls and even live for incoming  calls so you have the case closed you  get a call you can swipe on the case to  answer the call and then talk without  even removing it kind of like samsung's  SVU case and then when you're done  talking you can also end the call with  another swipe on the case and ever even  open the cover to begin with  now just so we're clear there's no  display built into the case there's just  a ton of translucent dots that let you  view into a very special mode that's  activated when this case is on your  phone so I guess that's explained by the  name dot view case and as long as you're  not activating it ridiculously often it  shouldn't have too much of an effect on  your battery life since you're waking  your phone the same amount of times just  get a slightly better looking  information summary so I think it's  awesome definitely a really unique  concept that legit adds value instead of  just being a silly gimmick or just  selling a case for the sake of being a  case and it's supposed to be available  soon in red blue orange black green and  this gray that I have here and I dig it  I normally don't do case reviews  obviously but imagine first-party cases  is this nice from more manufacturers  that'd be awesome  pretty much everyone I've shown this to  thinks it's basically the coolest case  ever and I'm gonna have to agree on that  one here so there you go just a quick  look at one of the first party  accessories for the HTC One m8 if you  haven't already seen my video going over  my first impressions of the new phone  itself that will be the first link below  that like button for you to check out it  was uploaded yesterday and I'm diggin it  so far so I'm gonna go again and get  back to testing the phone and the  subtour project edit and all the rest of  the stuff I have to do so thanks for  watching and I'll talk to you guys in  the next one peace
 

